---
// Pre-save / pre-add call-to-action. A single link to the band's Linkfire smart link
// (robocobraquartet.lnk.to/Haha), which runs the actual OAuth pre-save/pre-add per platform —
// something a static site cannot do itself. The five platform logos are shown only so visitors
// recognise their service; they are decorative (the whole card is one link). Logos are inlined
// SVG drawn with currentColor so they take the site's ink tone and invert on hover, with no
// runtime third-party requests. Spotify/Apple Music/Deezer/Tidal marks are from Simple Icons;
// Amazon Music (removed from Simple Icons) is a hand-drawn note-and-smile mark.
const LNK = 'https://robocobraquartet.lnk.to/Haha';
